(project pricklypear
 (doc "A multi-user Lisp operating system in the Smalltalk tradition: OCaml image binary, Postgres object store, htmx UI. Many humans, each with session + personal garden. One binary serves all sessions (single-image.borg); the multi-user product is auth.multi-user-product; isolation is multi-user.cotenant-isolation — session + branch scoped, one process.")
 (status partial)
